{"overview":"بی‌توجهی به قوانین جادوگری، نیمی از اعضای اندروئید ادورد الریک را از بدنش جدا کرد و جان برادرش آلفونس را به زره‌ای متصل کرد. برای بازگرداندن آنچه از دست رفته، برادران به دنبال سنگ فیلسوف می‌روند. دشمنان و حامیان – ارتش فاسد، هومونکولی‌ها و جادوگران خارجی – مسیر الریک‌ها را تغییر می‌دهند، اما هدفشان ثابت می‌ماند و پیوندشان شکست‌ناپذیر است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Disregard for alchemy’s laws ripped half of Edward Elric’s limbs from his body and left his brother Alphonse’s soul clinging to a suit of armor. To restore what was lost, the brothers seek the Philosopher’s Stone. Enemies and allies – the corrupt military, the Homunculi, and foreign alchemists – will alter the Elric brothers course, but their purpose will remain unchanged and their bond unbreakable.","tagline_en":"For what could equal the value of a human soul?","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":20,"y":2009,"poster":"/tXtBzlh6eLKSIyc9KUjRa3x0qX6.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":64,"y":2009,"poster":"/eb4gveExqCR0AhYM3EmCahwvvyg.jpg"}],"episodes":64,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"朴璐美","role":"Edward Elric (voice)","photo":"/fl9vyA3HEkOyTiZBJBhAR3OSmrO.jpg","en":"Romi Park"},{"name":"釘宮理恵","role":"Alphonse Elric (voice)","photo":"/xHonhNFpTpz9zCVXLAF7D4OuHLv.jpg","en":"Rie Kugimiya"},{"name":"三木眞一郎","role":"Roy Mustang (voice)","photo":"/yL9Tx2HZgK7t5AssYl6oGE9bjdj.jpg","en":"Shin-ichiro Miki"},{"name":"折笠富美子","role":"Riza Hawkeye (voice)","photo":"/f5d1J13fksa1hK8u7AS95aO8b9.jpg","en":"Fumiko Orikasa"},{"name":"高本めぐみ","role":"Winry Rockbell (voice)","photo":"/3gsw7BKhF70wCRDcnwavlz1U4FU.jpg","en":"Megumi Takamoto"}],"trailer":"RNwNA1M8A94","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31911-fullmetal-alchemist/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Hulu","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/44uAnmSqvA4yBOdbPWN8YgQHjWm.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo